2026-10-13 — Prevented ineligible report forms and backdrop click-through on defect detail

Root causes confirmed from the current paths: `OperationalFormService.publishedForDefect()` resolved forms from the defect's current status but did not exclude an initial defect-report version after its submission was already recorded, allowing stale or repeated report actions. The Galley Reviewer UI rendered its decision controls before the backend options request had confirmed eligibility, and `ReviewerQueueService` allowed a direct options/decision request for a Galley case before any initial report submission existed. Separately, shared `DialogPortal` dismissed on backdrop `mousedown`; removing the overlay before the browser's subsequent click allowed that click to reach the underlying page.

